@startuml
title US-001 - Register organization and admin - SD level 3 - Frontend
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 75
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2F8
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FEF9E7
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
autonumber

actor "Prospective Admin" as Admin
participant "RegisterPage" as View
participant "RegisterForm" as Component
participant "authService" as Service
participant "HttpClient" as Http
participant "Nexo API" as API

note over View, API
  RegisterForm is a two-step wizard (organization name, then admin details and
  password); only the final step submits. Credential/session delivery is not
  yet specified: a 201 redirects to /login instead of signing the admin in.
end note

Admin -> View: Submit organization, admin details, and password
activate View
View -> Component: handleSubmit(organizationName, adminFirstName, adminLastName, adminEmail, password)
activate Component
Component -> Service: register(dto)
activate Service
Service -> Http: POST /organizations (RegisterOrganizationDto)
activate Http
Http -> API: HTTP request
activate API
alt Request accepted
    API --> Http: 201 Created (OrganizationDto)
else Request rejected
    API --> Http: 400/409/500
end
deactivate API
Http --> Service: Response data or rejected request
deactivate Http
Service --> Component: void, or thrown error
deactivate Service
alt Successful response
    Component --> View: Navigate to /login?registered=1
else Failed response
    Component --> View: Error state (validation / operation failure)
end
deactivate Component
View --> Admin: Render the resulting state
deactivate View
@enduml
